msgstr ""
"Atributos de dados abstratos podem ser declarados usando o decorador "
"``@abstractproperty``::"

#: ../../whatsnew/2.6.rst:1295
msgid ""
"from abc import abstractproperty\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"@abstractproperty\n"
